error[NK1331]: `s` is `immutable`, but its value can change: `s.hits: SharedMut[i64]` is changeable through another owner.
  --> tests/immutable_shared_of_a_shared_mut.nika:7:16
   |
 7 | 	immutable s = Shared(Counter { hits: SharedMut(1) })
   |                ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ can change through another owner
   |
   = note: `immutable` promises that nothing reachable from the value ever changes (ADR-389). A `SharedMut`, a `Locked` and a channel end are changed through every other owner of the same storage.
   = help: Bind it with `let`, or hold a value that can't change: a copy, or a `Shared[T]` of a `T` that can't change.
1 type error
